    {
      "bbox": [
        347,
        298,
        1503,
        411
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "a. Oversee and coordinate the implementation of initiatives concerning LGBTQIA+\nNew Yorkers across all City agencies, including community outreach and public\neducation;",
