        "chars_per_1k_ink": 16.34
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347,
        954,
        1503,
        1187
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "e. In coordination with the Office of the Chief Counsel to the Mayor and City Hall, the Law Department, the New York City Commission on Human Rights, the Commission on Gender Equity, and other City entities as appropriate, develop legal resources to ensure the City's sanctuary status for LGBTQIA+ individuals is upheld, providing support for LGBTQIA+ people and their families escaping oppression for identifying as LGBTQIA+;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
