        1503,
        1380
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "f. Assume any function served by the NYC Unity Project prior to the effective date of this Order, including, but not limited to, any such function assigned by executive order or local law, and serve on the Gender and Racial Equity Advisory Board in place of the former Executive Director of the NYC Unity Project; and",
